          "name": "nutrition_compare",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:ccff50314c228048452993b1915c69c44758e512a9aebd22b4e2fa33d274fc22",
          "description": "Compare 2 to 5 foods side by side. Use this when the user asks \"which is healthier,\" \"which has more protein,\" or any cross-food comparison — it's cheaper and clearer than calling nutrition_detail multiple times. Returns each food's full nutrition plus per-nutrient winners (highest protein, lowest sodium, etc.). Charges $0.003 USDC per call.",
