          "canonical_hash": "sha256:bbd984381d5c52e925f172e71a3f4f1a633f64f89b86580c4580f70af9c4a2eb",
          "description": "Find foods in the USDA FoodData Central database by free-text name. Use this FIRST when the user mentions a food by name and you need its `fdc_id` for any of the other nutrition_* tools. Returns ranked matches with fdc_id, description, brand_owner, and a quick macro summary (calories/protein/carbs/fat per 100g). Charges $0.001 USDC per call.",
